# Line endings: LF in the repository, always.
#
# GitHub renders and diffs LF; a clone that re-derives CRLF working copies
# (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) shows every file as modified for no reason.
# `text=auto` lets git detect binaries and leave them alone; `eol=lf` fixes the
# checkout form so a Windows clone matches the index byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only scripts keep CRLF: cmd.exe and PowerShell handle LF poorly in
# some paths, and nothing else reads these files.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
